  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bathula Brahmananda Reddy, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 11 December, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition Nos.5724, 5728, 5731 And 5739 Of 2020 Common Order:",
    "facts": "Therefore, they would pray for quash of these F.I.Rs registered against these petitioners also.",
    "arguments": "5. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor would fairly concede that these are covered matters in view of the earlier orders of this Court and thereby prayed to pass appropriate orders accordingly in these petitions also. Bathula Brahmananda Reddy, vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 11 December, 2020 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/173420829/ 1 6.",
